        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending it Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless emergency staircase.<br>You don’t know how you got here, and there’s no clear exit in sight.<br>One thing is certain—you must <strong>climb up to escape</strong>.<br>The way out is on the <strong>20th floor</strong>, but the path won’t be simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend, you will encounter two doors on each floor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you notice an anomaly, take the left door.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there are no anomalies, take the right door.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With collapsing stairs and a space filled with clutter, can you overcome the tension and find your way out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Climb the stairs, make your choices, and find your way out. A new chapter with a unique theme begins every <strong>5 floors</strong>.<br>✔ <strong>Simple yet profound decision-making</strong> – Your observation and judgment are the keys to survival.<br>✔ <strong>Supports Korean &amp; English</strong> – A user-friendly interface for an immersive experience.<br>✔ <strong>20-60 minutes of playtime</strong> – A short yet intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the ever-looping staircase.<br>Can you <strong>make it all the way to the top?</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ending it Today</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/978689992da2ad9f702e037afcfad16d.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an endless emergency staircase.<br>You don’t know how you got here, and there’s no clear exit in sight.<br>One thing is certain—you must <strong>climb up to escape</strong>.<br>The way out is on the <strong>20th floor</strong>, but the path won’t be simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you ascend, you will encounter two doors on each floor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you notice an anomaly, take the left door.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If there are no anomalies, take the right door.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With collapsing stairs and a space filled with clutter, can you overcome the tension and find your way out?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.poster.avif?t=1752820214\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.webm?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553690/extras/aca0722f0c551f146b0d4a07e2434bad.mp4?t=1752820214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Climb the stairs, make your choices, and find your way out. A new chapter with a unique theme begins every <strong>5 floors</strong>.<br>✔ <strong>Simple yet profound decision-making</strong> – Your observation and judgment are the keys to survival.<br>✔ <strong>Supports Korean &amp; English</strong> – A user-friendly interface for an immersive experience.<br>✔ <strong>20-60 minutes of playtime</strong> – A short yet intense experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to escape the ever-looping staircase.<br>Can you <strong>make it all the way to the top?</strong></p>",
